      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'll back this up.  It's useful for making custom portals that give a world a unique look vs the usual round/sparkly portals.\nI understand that the internals of the object are subject to change and I'd be fine with correcting prefabs with any changes as long as the method to change those remains accessible. :)   Thanks.",
